# File / 文件：.gitignore
# EN: Repository ignore policy for secrets, runtime data, archives, and local editor files.
# 中文：仓库忽略策略，用于排除密钥、运行时数据、压缩包及本地编辑器文件。
# Maintenance / 维护：Never weaken exclusions for .env, logs, uploads, or release archives. / 不得弱化 .env、日志、上传文件或发布包的排除规则。
.env
.env.*
*.log
*.dump
*.zip
/vendor/
/storage/uploads/*
!/storage/uploads/.gitkeep
/storage/logs/*
!/storage/logs/.gitkeep
/.vscode/
/.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
